        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Derin %@ (%@). Constellation facts and distances will be checked against an astronomy source before release.\n\nAmbient recordings from Freesound: rain by jmbphilmes, forest by kvgarlic, fireplace by 16FThumaF (CC0), waves by Luftrum (CC BY)."
          }
        }
      }
